t:** $6,896.22, the full invoice amount\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent, and the invoice now shows as paid\n\nThe wire request timed out at first, and right after that no payment showed up. Instead of sending it again or switching to ACH, I checked a second time and found the wire had gone through, just late. So there's only one payment. Because it's under $10,000, it didn't need controller approval.\n\nAcme has two other invoices that I didn't touch. INV-47800 ($7,314.58) is still a draft waiting for approval, and INV-91954 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}